{"title":"LaTeX操作","uid":"0b720979fc7391d027a05e038a05d97d","slug":"LaTeX","date":"2025-06-07T23:00:00.000Z","updated":"2025-06-10T16:03:18.577Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/LaTeX.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/images/cover/LaTeX.webp","content":"<div class=\"custom-quote danger\">\n<span class=\"custom-quote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M19.76 5.23C15.84 5.23 12 2 12 2C12 2 8.15996 5.23 4.23996 5.23C4.23996 5.23 1.86996 16.99 12 22C22.13 16.99 19.76 5.23 19.76 5.23Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M12 8V13\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M11.99 16H12\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"custom-quote-title\">注意</p>\n<p>本文为编者自用，所使用的软件为<strong>TeXStudio</strong>，设备系统为<strong>macOS最高配置</strong>。<br>Mac系统和Windows系统的键盘符号对应如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Mac</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Win</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌘</code> (<code>command</code>, <code>cmd</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>ctrl</code> (control)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌥</code> (<code>option</code>, <code>opt</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>alt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌃</code> (<code>control</code>, <code>ctrl</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\">无对应键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⇧</code> (<code>shift</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⇧</code> (<code>shift</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"表格操作\"><a href=\"#表格操作\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"表格操作\"></a>表格操作</h1><h2 id=\"表格高度与宽度\"><a href=\"#表格高度与宽度\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"表格高度与宽度\"></a>表格高度与宽度</h2><ol>\n<li>表格高度 <figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">% 两倍行距</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\renewcommand</span>&#123;<span class=\"keyword\">\\arraystretch</span>&#125;&#123;2&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li>表格宽度 <figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">% 文字两侧留出10pt的距离</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\setlength</span>&#123;<span class=\"keyword\">\\tabcolsep</span>&#125;&#123;10pt&#125; </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"表格浮动\"><a href=\"#表格浮动\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"表格浮动\"></a>表格浮动</h2><figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\begin</span>&#123;wraptable&#125;&#123;r&#125;&#123;7cm&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">\\centering</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">\\begin</span>&#123;tabular&#125;&#123;|c|c|c|&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"keyword\">\\hline</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"built_in\">&amp;</span> Failure <span class=\"built_in\">&amp;</span> Success<span class=\"keyword\">\\\\</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"keyword\">\\hline</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tTreatment <span class=\"built_in\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"built_in\">$</span>a<span class=\"built_in\">$</span> <span class=\"built_in\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"built_in\">$</span>b<span class=\"built_in\">$</span><span class=\"keyword\">\\\\</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"keyword\">\\hline</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tControl <span class=\"built_in\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"built_in\">$</span>c<span class=\"built_in\">$</span> <span class=\"built_in\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"built_in\">$</span>d<span class=\"built_in\">$</span><span class=\"keyword\">\\\\</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"keyword\">\\hline</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">\\end</span>&#123;tabular&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\end</span>&#123;wraptable&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p><img src=\"/images/content/LaTeX/%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%E6%B5%AE%E5%8A%A8.png\" alt=\"表格浮动\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"图片操作\"><a href=\"#图片操作\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"图片操作\"></a>图片操作</h1><h1 id=\"数学符号\"><a href=\"#数学符号\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"数学符号\"></a>数学符号</h1><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">内容</th>\n<th align=\"left\">代码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">下标换行</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\lim_&#123;\\substack&#123;i\\to0\\\\j\\to0&#125;&#125;f(x,y)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","feature":true,"text":"编者自用的LaTeX操作技巧...","permalink":"/post/LaTeX","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":737,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"LaTeX","slug":"LaTeX","count":1,"path":"api/categories/LaTeX.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Self-use","slug":"Self-use","count":3,"path":"api/tags/Self-use.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C\"><span class=\"toc-text\">表格操作<